// P10b armor endowments (17 hardmode sets + 5 pre-HM sets handed over from P10a); the four Ancient Hallowed combos share one line
GsForbiddenArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Sandbound Shades: strikes build sand-soul; at 6 stacks a sand shade rises (up to 2) to haunt your side
	The shade spits whirling sand bolts at the nearest enemy
	'''
GsSpookyWoodArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Hallow's Patrol: strikes build soulfire; at 6 stacks a jack-o'-lantern rises (up to 2) to patrol around you
	The lantern spits triple ghostflame at the nearest foe
	'''
GsChlorophyteArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Symbiotic Vine: strikes build spores; at 8 stacks the next strike plants a parasite vine into the target
	Every strike on the host lashes a vine-blade at a second foe, and the vine bursts into spores when it withers
	'''
GsPumpkinArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Gourd Harvest: strikes build vines; at 6 stacks the next strike plants a blast gourd under the target
	The gourd ripens in 3s (strike the victim again to force it), bursting into three spinning slices
	'''
GsGladiatorArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Triumph Volley: strikes build acclaim; at 6 stacks the next strike hurls three bronze javelins from your shoulder
	The javelins pin the foe in arcing volleys
	'''
